,"source_cn":"祖娅收回机械助手，头也不回地离开了现场。余下的矮人面面...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71BAE881C7637C21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:74:1064302055:0":{"text":"너, 너너너너! 너 미쳤어?!\n내 폭탄을 대체 어떻게 개조한 거야?!","source_cn":"你——你你你你你这个神经病！\\n你把本大人的炸弹改装成...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x823B3F4DFF8BE487","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:75:1064302056:1":{"text":"쿠루루 님이 제때 남은 폭발을 막지 않았으면 깊은바위 마을이 몽땅 날아갔을 거다!","source_cn":"要不是库露露大人及时制止了余爆，深岩村都要被炸光光了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E5FBBF14F28326C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:76:1064302057:0":{"text":"화력 강화.\n상급.","source_cn":"火力增强。\\n上佳。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A61C739792C52AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:77:1064302058:0":{"text":"틀린 말은 아니지만, 이건 내 폭탄이잖아!\n개조 효과는 나한테 제대로 설명해야지! <style=\"highlight\">위력이 이렇게까지 강해질 줄은 몰랐단 말이야</style>!","source_cn":"话是这么说没错，但这是我的炸弹！\\n你得跟我说清楚改装...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72C81A73E257D184","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:78:1064302059:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:79:1064302060:0":{"text":"야, 그런 표정 짓지 마. 억울한 건 나라고!","source_cn":"啊喂，别摆出那副样子，该委屈的是本大人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE51E9F2DB85A4FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:80:1064302061:0":{"text":"화력, 최고!\n쿠루스터, 규칙, 많다. 인간처럼... 그럼, 멋지지 않다.","source_cn":"火力至上！\\n库露丝塔，规矩，很多。像人类，不酷。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9370EC1B912CB4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:81:1064302062:0":{"text":"무엄하다! 감히 존귀하신 쿠루루 님께 그게 무슨 말버릇이냐?!","source_cn":"放肆！怎么跟尊贵的库露露大人讲话的？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6EB12A638EC48CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:82:1064302063:1":{"text":"크흠, 인간의 규칙도 가끔은 일리가 있거든!\n네가 내 팬만 아니었어도 진작 쫓아냈을 거야!","source_cn":"咳咳，人类的规矩偶尔也有点道理！\\n要不是因为你是我的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12679A880CBFFF34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:83:1064302064:0":{"text":"그래! 이 머릿속에 화력밖에 없는 쇠대가리야! 쿠루루 님께서 넓은 아량을 베풀어 주신 걸 다행으로 여겨라!","source_cn":"没错！庆幸库露露大人具有如此开阔的心胸吧，你这个脑子里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x879FC1A3E8F7769D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:84:1064302065:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:85:1064302066:0":{"text":"...됐어, 멍청한 쇠대가리랑 이런 얘기해서 뭐 하겠어.","source_cn":"……算了算了。我就不跟你这个笨蛋铁块头计较了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9E0E29DACC23E4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:86:1064302067:0":{"text":"아무튼, 다음에 내 물건을 건드릴 땐... 나한테! 먼저! 제! 대! 로! 설명해!","source_cn":"总之，下次动我的东西之前，先——找——我——说——清——楚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF5724BA251FDB0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:88:1064302068:0":{"text":"군나르는 쿠루루의 말을 못 들은 척, 몸을 돌려 대구경 포신을 살펴보러 갔다.","source_cn":"勒图姆对库露露的话置若罔闻，转身端详一根大口径炮管去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B8390550DBDCAFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:89:1064302069:0":{"text":"야! 너 아예 안 듣고 있지?!","source_cn":"喂！你根本没在听吧？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD64DB740131A6FA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","varia